                    "line": 239,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "I'd suggest not using `$HOME`, or at least, if using `$HOME`, put it in `$XDG_CACHE_HOME` (which defaults to `${HOME}/.cache` according to [the XDG specification](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/basedir/latest/).\n\nThis way it's either not included in backups by default, or if it is, it's easy to exclude with all the rest of the cache data.\n\nPlease fix throughout."
                },
